# DonDron (code repo)

Implementation workspace for the DonDron autonomous UAV project (Line 1 — public stack).

## Read first (every session)

- Vault context: `~/Projects/nexus/01_Projects/Robotics/DonDron/CONTEXT.md`
- Active tasks: `~/Projects/nexus/01_Projects/Robotics/DonDron/Tasks/`
- Session handoff: `~/Projects/nexus/01_Projects/Nexus_Infrastructure/Docs/User Guide/Agent Session Checklist.md`
- Architecture (vault): `01_Projects/Robotics/DonDron/Docs/hybrid-architecture-blueprint.md`
- Code-repo dev state: `docs/dev_state.md`
- Guardrails: `AGENTS.md`

## Stack conventions

- **ROS 2:** Jazzy Jalisco — source `/opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash` before PX4 build or sim
- **DDS domain:** `ROS_DOMAIN_ID=42` on all machines (avoid multi-machine conflicts)
- **Build:** colcon in `ros2_ws/` (`--symlink-install` on Main PC overlay)
- **PX4:** upstream clone at `~/PX4-Autopilot` — do not vendor into this repo
- **Gazebo:** Harmonic (`gz sim`); ROS bridge via `ros-jazzy-ros-gz`
- **SIL bridge:** see `docs/sil-bridge.md` — agent before PX4, source ROS first

## Development machines

| Machine | Role |
|---------|------|
| **Main PC** (Linux Mint 22, RTX 4070) | Primary SIL/HIL, GPU vision, native PX4 + Gazebo |
| **MacBook** (Docker Dev Container) | ROS 2 package dev, launch files, BT logic — **not** full SIL |

Mac rule: develop nodes in Dev Container; run integration/sim on Main PC. Never promise full SIL on Mac.

## Rules

- Trackable work → nexus vault task notes — not inline TODO/FIXME comments
- Architecture and planning stay in the vault — build/run docs go in this repo `docs/`
- At session end: update `docs/dev_state.md` + vault task (`status`, checkboxes, notes with branch/commit)
- Do not duplicate large experiment logs into the vault
- Guidance / intercept logic → private repo Line 2+ only — see `public-boundary.mdc`
- Git commits: Conventional Commits per `.cursor/rules/github.mdc` — use skill `dondron-git-commit` when committing

## Package layout (`ros2_ws/src/`)

| Package | Role |
|---------|------|
| `dondron_description` | URDF/SDF model, meshes |
| `dondron_bringup` | Launch files, system params |
| `dondron_bridge` | Micro-XRCE-DDS Agent config |
| `dondron_perception` | YOLO/RKNN inference, `/detections` |
| `dondron_flight_api` | Generic Offboard setpoint interface — **no** `/detections` input |
| `dondron_state_machine` | BehaviorTree.CPP v4 — public states through TRACK |
| `dondron_diagnostics` | Health monitoring, rosbag triggers |

Guidance bridge and ENGAGE BT live in `dondron-guidance-private` (Line 2+) — not in this repo.

Global nexus behavior is in Cursor User Rules (copied from `nexus/.cursor/rules/nexus-vault.mdc`).
